<title>FRANCE: TABLE-Moulinex Q1 sales slip 2.5 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Moulinex Q1 sales slip 2.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30.</p>
<p>(all figures in millions of francs unless started).</p>
<p>    Sales			    1,609	vs   1,650</p>
<p>NOTE - Moulinex said the sales were down 4.3 percent on a like-for-like basis. It said a growth in North American sales had not compensated the terrible state of the European market. It said it maintained its forecast of a significant increase in operating profit and capital employed over the next 18 months. Moulinex said finance director Michel Ybert would resign from the company on October 31. Francois Carriere assumes his responsibilities from July 28.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
